{"id":"1f1a5dcc2c5a5996","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable.md","title":"A True but Unprovable Consistency Sentence of Modal G","display":"thm-modal-consistency-unprovable — A True but Unprovable Consistency Sentence of Modal G","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable","aliases":["92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable"],"display":"thm-modal-consistency-unprovable — A True but Unprovable Consistency Sentence of Modal G","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-prop-modal-system-types]]","[[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]","[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]","[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modal-consistency-unprovable — A True but Unprovable Consistency Sentence of Modal G"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8efcec738ec44109\" href=\"?note=8efcec738ec44109\" title=\"92-prop-modal-system-types\">92-prop-modal-system-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb3ae520d70609fb\" href=\"?note=bb3ae520d70609fb\" title=\"92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability\">92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"62ba454c37d12a16\" href=\"?note=62ba454c37d12a16\" title=\"92-df-modal-letterless-truth\">92-df-modal-letterless-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box\\bot\">\\(C_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box\\bot\\)</span>，原书 G 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathsf G_{\\Box}}^0(C_{\\Box})\\land\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash C_{\\Box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathsf G_{\\Box}}^0(C_{\\Box})\\land\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash C_{\\Box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一致性给 G 不证明底，因此 Box 底假、C 真。若 G 证明 C，即 Box 底→底，Nec 给 Box(Box 底→底)，A4 给 Box 底，MP 给底，违背一致性。</p>\n<p>只用具体模态 G、Nec、Löb 公理及一致性，不调用算术码或全部固定点存在性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-prop-modal-system-types","status":"resolved","id":"8efcec738ec44109","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-prop-modal-system-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability","status":"resolved","id":"bb3ae520d70609fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-letterless-truth","status":"resolved","id":"62ba454c37d12a16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf G_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathsf G_{\\Box}}^0(C_{\\Box})\\land\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash C_{\\Box}.","display":true}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]、[[92-thm-modal-no-negated-box]]、[[92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable]]给出一致性不可证与练习15–16。letterless 稳定性不未经证明推广到含命题变量的全部公式域。"},{"id":"ec030649243aa657","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]"}],"outgoing":["8efcec738ec44109","bb3ae520d70609fb","3c0bfff14ec726c0","62ba454c37d12a16"]}